{"seq":28,"data":{"type":"RUN_FINISHED","threadId":"4601e08c-0777-4ae5-9368-6a4781a937b5","runId":"run_1_1788527768041","result":"Done! I've saved the regex pattern to `/app/regex.txt`.\n\nThe pattern works as follows:\n\n- **`^(?=...IPv4...)`** - Lookahead ensures the line contains an IPv4 address with proper word boundaries\n- **`.*`** - Greedy match to position just before the last date (due to backtracking)\n- **`(?<![A-Za-z0-9])(\\d{4}-(?:0[1-9]|1[0-2])-(?:0[1-9]|[12]\\d|3[01]))(?![A-Za-z0-9])`** - Captures the date with word boundaries:\n  - Month: `0[1-9]|1[0-2]` → 01-12\n  - Day: `0[1-9]|[12]\\d|3[01]` → 01-31 (includes Feb 29)\n- **`.*$`** - Matches remaining characters to end of line\n\nThe IPv4 octet pattern `(?:25[0-5]|2[0-4]\\d|1\\d{2}|[1-9]?\\d)` correctly matches 0-255 without leading zeros. The negative lookbehind/lookahead assertions prevent false matches like \"user 1234-12-1234\".","rawEvent":{"duration_api_ms":92199,"stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"4601e08c-0777-4ae5-9368-6a4781a937b5","total_cost_usd":0.0906515,"usage":{"input_tokens":17,"cache_creation_input_tokens":14076,"cache_read_input_tokens":26765,"output_tokens":13829,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":13088},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":14076},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":8,"output_tokens":771,"cache_read_input_tokens":13854,"cache_creation_input_tokens":13133,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":13133,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":1158,"outputTokens":12,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.001218,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000,"thinkingTokens":0,"canonicalModel":"claude-haiku-4-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"},"claude-